The customer is dissatisfied with the durability of the vacuum cleaner, specifically the drop in suction power after just three months, and expresses disappointment with the customer support, which they felt did not provide a satisfactory solution. To address these concerns, the company could enhance product durability by using higher-quality materials or redesigning the product, improve customer support by providing more comprehensive training and resources for effective solutions, review pricing strategy to ensure it aligns with product quality, offer warranty and maintenance options for customer peace of mind, and implement a feedback and quality control system to collect and act on customer feedback, preventing similar issues in the future.
